### ============================================================================
### Dashboard.http — Dashboard data requests.
###
### Prerequisites:
### 1. Get a JWT token by running Login from Auth.http.
### 2. Paste the token into http-client.env.json.
### ============================================================================


### ============================================================================
### Get Dashboard
### GET /api/dashboard — Returns aggregated dashboard data for the current user.
### Requires: [Authorize] (any authenticated user).
### ============================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================================================
### Get SysAdmin Dashboard
### GET /api/dashboard/sysadmin — Returns system-wide dashboard data.
### Requires: [Authorize(Roles = "SysAdmin")].
### ============================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/sysadmin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
